{"id":"vod_sn_37561","vodId":"37561","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"黄昏少女×失忆","name_cn":"黄昏少女×失忆","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/071542a9a43ecfb99d85150a7e3702e4.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《黄昏乙女×失忆幽灵》改编自日本漫画家めいびい原作的同名漫画。故事发生在诚教学园初中部，由于历史悠久的缘故，许多不思议事件在校园中广为流传。某日，少年新谷真一迷失在了犹如迷宫一般的校舍之间，夕阳下，一个黑发少女的身影出现在了他的视线中。少女穿着真一没有见过的古老校服，空洞的眼神里充满了哀怨。难道，我遇见了幽灵？真一兴奋的这样想着。原来，幽灵少女名叫庚夕子，15岁那年不幸去世，因为失去了记忆，因此也想不起来究竟是如何死去的，为此苦恼的夕子这才每日徘徊在校园之中，成为了众多灵异事件的始作俑者。作为唯一能够看见夕子存在的人，真一成为了寻找夕子记忆的头号人选，一个名为“灵异调查部”的社团就这样成立了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RrsabZK9GK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ycaX1xy5gB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8F149YQxjz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yq3bhDy0bv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zGXtmkwmE01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aKzCv4JZ3Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sw2fgs7uX01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3nD5yXY8ZC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RseNff90zE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6Sy6PATwdn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UkLGt6yxGk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BhGxtv0jwV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VecLS9D3761/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:09.487Z"}